- learn how to develop and maintain user-friendly dashboards and support others in using them effectively;
- set KPIs and implement A/B tests to optimize player income throughout the game lifecycle;
- use Python to conduct exploratory and statistical analyses and tackle product problems such as matchmaking, player segmentation, and more.


